  "name": "Chicken Stew",
  "subtitle": "A creamy vegetable stew with tender chicken",
  "description": "Build a simple roux with aromatics, broth, and milk, then simmer it with vegetables, peas, corn, and cooked chicken for a hearty six-serving meal.",
